 },
 "sentences": [
  {
   "text": "Grandpa's phone had one app open.",
   "nefes": 0.15,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "I did not expect it to be mine.",
   "nefes": 0.4,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "I finally got into his office.",
   "nefes": 0.15,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "Dust, drawings, cold tea.",
   "nefes": 0.15,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "And his phone, still on the charger.",
   "nefes": 0.3,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "On the screen: Demolition Master.",
   "nefes": 0.15,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "Level twelve.",
   "nefes": 0.2,
   "mark": "game",
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "He was stuck.",
   "nefes": 0.15,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "Grandpa.",
   "nefes": 0.4,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "Who took down real buildings for forty years.",
   "nefes": 0.4,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "I finished the level for him.",
   "nefes": 0.15,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "It took me three tries.",
   "nefes": 0.4,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "Then I looked at the drawings.",
   "nefes": 0.15,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "They were of Daisy.",
   "nefes": 0.15,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "Grandpa built something into her.",
   "nefes": 0.15,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "A sensor.",
   "nefes": 0.3,
   "mark": "sensor",
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "When the ground or the load is wrong, she beeps.",
   "nefes": 1.05,
   "mark": "beep",
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "Twice.",
   "nefes": 0.3,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "It means: stop.",
   "nefes": 0.6,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "So Daisy was never grumpy.",
   "nefes": 0.15,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "Daisy was warning me.",
   "nefes": 0.15,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "At the chimney, she was right.",
   "nefes": 0.5,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "Then I saw the calendar on the wall.",
   "nefes": 0.15,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "It was hanging very low.",
   "nefes": 0.15,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "I moved it.",
   "nefes": 0.3,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "Behind it, a crack.",
   "nefes": 0.6,
   "mark": "crack",
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "From the floor to the ceiling.",
   "nefes": 0.4,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "And I remembered.",
   "nefes": 0.15,
   "mark": null,
   "kim": "anlatici"
  },
  {
   "text": "Daisy beeped at this door.",
   "nefes": 0,
   "mark": "end",
   "kim": "anlatici"
  }
